#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "<span class=\"o_form_label\">Reservation invoice lock</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"o_form_label\">Bloqueo de facturación de reservas</span>"

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Block validating reservation invoices too early. Draft\n"
"                            invoices can still be created (proforma); down payment\n"
"                            invoices are never blocked."
msgstr ""
"Impide validar demasiado pronto las facturas de reservas. Las facturas en "
"borrador se pueden crear igualmente (proforma); las facturas de anticipo "
"nunca se bloquean."

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.selection__res_company__reservation_invoice_block_policy__other
msgid "Custom domain"
msgstr "Dominio personalizado"

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.selection__res_company__reservation_invoice_block_policy__disabled
msgid "Do not block"
msgstr "No bloquear"

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_company__reservation_invoice_block_domain
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_config_settings__reservation_invoice_block_domain
msgid ""
"Domain over reservations that cannot be invoiced yet (only used when the policy is 'Custom domain'). If any reservation of an invoice matches this domain, the invoice cannot be validated; all reservations must be outside the domain to post. Only stored reservation fields can be used. Use the code editor of the domain widget for date-relative conditions, e.g. not before checkout:\n"
"[('checkout', '>', context_today().strftime('%Y-%m-%d'))]"
msgstr ""
"Dominio sobre reservas que aún no se pueden facturar (solo se usa con la política 'Dominio personalizado'). Si alguna reserva de la factura cumple este dominio, la factura no se puede validar; todas las reservas deben quedar fuera del dominio para poder validar. Solo se pueden usar campos almacenados de la reserva. Usa el editor de código del widget de dominio para condiciones con fecha dinámica, p. ej. no antes del checkout:\n"
"[('checkout', '>', context_today().strftime('%Y-%m-%d'))]"

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Ex.: Invoices cannot be validated before the guest checks out."
msgstr "Ej.: No se pueden validar facturas antes de que el huésped haga el checkout."

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_company__reservation_invoice_block_message
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_config_settings__reservation_invoice_block_message
msgid ""
"Message shown to the user when the lock prevents posting an invoice. Explain"
" the rule in plain words (e.g. 'Invoices cannot be validated before the "
"guest checks out'). If empty, a generic message is used. The blocking "
"reservations are always listed after this message."
msgstr ""
"Mensaje que se muestra al usuario cuando el bloqueo impide validar una "
"factura. Explica la regla en lenguaje claro (p. ej. 'No se pueden validar "
"facturas antes de que el huésped haga el checkout'). Si se deja vacío, se "
"usa un mensaje genérico. Las reservas que bloquean se listan siempre "
"después de este mensaje."

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.selection__res_company__reservation_invoice_block_policy__checkin
msgid "Not before check-in"
msgstr "No antes del check-in"

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.selection__res_company__reservation_invoice_block_policy__checkout
msgid "Not before check-out"
msgstr "No antes del check-out"

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
