#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_reservation_invoice_lock/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Reservations preventing validation:"
msgstr "Reservas que impiden la validación:"

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_company__reservation_invoice_block_policy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pms_reservation_invoice_lock.field_res_config_settings__reservation_invoice_block_policy
msgid ""
"When to block validating (posting) a reservation's regular invoice. 'Do not "
"block' disables the lock; 'Not before check-in' blocks reservations arriving"
" in the future; 'Not before check-out' blocks stays that have not departed "
"yet; 'Custom domain' uses the domain below. Draft invoices can always be "
"created; down payment invoices are never blocked."
msgstr ""
"Cuándo bloquear la validación (posteo) de la factura regular de una reserva. "
"'No bloquear' desactiva el bloqueo; 'No antes del check-in' bloquea las "
"reservas que llegan en el futuro; 'No antes del check-out' bloquea las "
"estancias que aún no han salido; 'Dominio personalizado' usa el dominio de "
"abajo. Las facturas en borrador siempre se pueden crear; las facturas de "
"anticipo nunca se bloquean."

#. module: pms_reservation_invoice_lock
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_reservation_invoice_lock/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You cannot validate this invoice yet: some of the invoiced reservations do "
"not meet the conditions set to be invoiced."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no puede validar esta factura: alguna de las reservas facturadas no "
"cumple las condiciones establecidas para poder facturarse."
